<div class="wrap">
  <div class="top">
    <h1>Jeju road trip · 4 days in March</h1>
    <p>A self-drive loop for Anup and friends' families: west coast, south coast, east coast, then back to the airport for Busan. Every meal stop is vegan or has clearly vegan dishes; cheese pizza and ice cream breaks are included. Tap a number on the map to jump to that stop.</p>
    <ul class="facts">
      <li>4 days · 3 nights</li><li>~250 km of driving in total</li><li>Rental car from Jeju Airport</li><li>Canola & cherry blossoms: mid–late March</li>
