  <div class="notes">
    <div class="note">
      <h2>Show this when ordering</h2>
      <p>Many Korean side dishes and soups use fish sauce or anchovy broth. This line says: "Please leave out meat, fish, seafood, anchovy broth and fish sauce. Milk and cheese are fine."</p>
      <div class="phrase" id="phrase" lang="ko">고기, 생선, 해산물, 멸치육수, 젓갈은 빼주세요. 우유와 치즈는 괜찮아요.</div>
      <button type="button" class="copy" id="copyBtn">Copy Korean text</button>
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      <h2>Driving</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Bring a booklet-type International Driving Permit (1949 Geneva Convention; India qualifies), the Indian licence and passport. Many rental firms want the IDP issued within the last year, drivers aged 21+, and a credit card in the driver's name.</li>
        <li>Big group? A Kia Carnival (9 seats) or Hyundai Staria (11 seats) keeps everyone in one car; otherwise two cars.</li>
        <li>Child seats are required by law for children under 6; ask for boosters for younger primary-school kids.</li>
        <li>Google Maps shows places but cannot give driving directions in Korea; use Naver Map or Kakao Map (English menus) for navigation.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      <h2>Good to know</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Vegan cafés keep short or changing hours and several close Tue–Thu. Call or check Naver the day before.</li>
        <li>Hotel breakfast buffets (fruit, bread, salad, rice porridge, eggs) are the easiest vegetarian breakfast.</li>
        <li>March is cool and very windy on the coast: bring a windproof jacket.</li>
        <li>Outdoor hotel pools mostly open from April–June, so expect them closed.</li>
        <li>Extra treat: Udo island ferry from Seongsan for peanut ice cream, if Day 3 has spare time.</li>
        <li>Cheese pizza swap: Pizza Dolharbang in Cheongsu-ri, near O'sulloc (sweet-potato or potato pizza; skip bulgogi). Lunch hours, closed Mon.</li>
        <li>Jeju Fire Festival ★: Held 9–14 March in 2026 (digital &#x27;fire&#x27; show, torch parade). 2027 dates not announced yet.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="foot">Prepared by Paul Kim, INOPOL. Opening hours and hotel details were checked in November 2026 from HappyCow, Spinach, hotel listings and Korean news; please re-confirm closer to the trip.</p>
</div>
<script>
(function(){
  var pins=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#map .pin'));
  var routes=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('#map .route'));
  var btns=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.filters button'));
  var days=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.day'));
  function show(f){
    btns.forEach(function(b){b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b.dataset.f===f));});
    pins.concat(routes).forEach(function(el){
      var d=el.getAttribute('data-day');
      el.classList.toggle('dim', f!=='all' && d!==f && d!=='opt');
    });
    days.forEach(function(s){s.style.display=(f==='all'||s.dataset.day===f)?'':'none';});
  }
  btns.forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){show(b.dataset.f);});});
  function go(id){
    var el=document.getElementById(id); if(!el) return;
    var sec=el.closest('.day'); if(sec && sec.style.display==='none') show('all');
    el.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});
    document.querySelectorAll('.hl').forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('hl');});
    el.classList.add('hl');
    pins.forEach(function(p){if(p.dataset.target===id)p.classList.add('hl');});
  }
  pins.forEach(function(p){
    if(!p.dataset.target) return;
    p.addEventListener('click',function(){go(p.dataset.target);});
    p.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){if(e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();go(p.dataset.target);}});
  });
  document.querySelectorAll('.stop').forEach(function(s){
    s.addEventListener('mouseenter',function(){pins.forEach(function(p){p.classList.toggle('hl',p.dataset.target===s.id);});});
  });
  var cb=document.getElementById('copyBtn');
  cb.addEventListener('click',function(){
    var t=document.getElementById('phrase').textContent;
    try{navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(function(){cb.textContent='Copied';},function(){cb.textContent='Select the text above to copy';});}
    catch(e){cb.textContent='Select the text above to copy';}
  });
})();
</script>
